WEBVTT

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:13.179
That is everything
I have to report, sir.

00:00:14.096 --> 00:00:15.556
Understood.

00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:18.684
An unauthorized sortie
is a violation.

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:21.521
However,
your quick and decisive action

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:23.356
helped minimize squad casualties...

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:27.860
and curtailed any serious harm
to the World of the Living.

00:00:28.277 --> 00:00:29.278
Therefore...

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:33.699
I will overlook your violation
of squad rules!

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:34.909
Yes!

00:00:34.992 --> 00:00:35.993
I mean...

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.453
Thank you, sir!

00:00:38.412 --> 00:00:43.000
I'd say failing to retrieve
the remains of this mystery Hollow

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:45.044
is a serious enough crime.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.671
By the way...

00:00:47.171 --> 00:00:50.883
Your report only describes
how unusual the Hollow was...

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:54.679
I trust you didn't leave
anything out.

00:00:55.304 --> 00:01:00.434
That...
there was nothing else noteworthy?

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.732
Yes, sir.
There wasn't anything else.

00:01:08.484 --> 00:01:11.487
JUNE 5TH, 11:00
SEITO ACADEMY HIGH SCHOOL

00:01:17.785 --> 00:01:18.703
I wonder

00:01:18.786 --> 00:01:21.330
if that Soul Reaper made it back
to the Soul Society safely...

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:24.250
I hope he's not in trouble...

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:30.381
I should have at least
asked for his name.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.010
THE SEIREITEI - SQUAD 10 BARRACKS

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:41.809
I guess those rumors about Quincies
still being alive were true.

00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:46.230
It must have taken a lot of courage
for her to save me...

00:01:46.314 --> 00:01:50.276
and tell me that she's a Quincy,
knowing that I'm a Soul Reaper.

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:52.987
She's really something.

00:01:54.071 --> 00:01:56.741
I should have chatted with her
a bit more.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:04.165
Maybe I'll go back
and thank her properly this time.

00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:07.919
I told you, Ryu is my cousin!

00:02:08.169 --> 00:02:09.796
There's nothing going on
between us.

00:02:10.046 --> 00:02:13.049
You're living together,
so there has to be something!

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:14.509
Come on...

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:17.345
Huh?
H-Hey!

00:02:17.428 --> 00:02:18.429
Masaki?

00:02:19.597 --> 00:02:20.848
Oh, I-I'm sorry!

00:02:21.265 --> 00:02:23.184
Don't worry about it.

00:02:23.392 --> 00:02:25.436
I hope you're okay, young lady.

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:28.648
Are you okay?

00:02:28.731 --> 00:02:30.733
Hey! Was that a new trick
to meeting people?!

00:02:30.858 --> 00:02:33.027
Why would you think that?!

00:02:56.843 --> 00:03:01.681
The blue skies above are hopelessly clear

00:03:01.806 --> 00:03:06.894
At my wit's end, I feel a growing frustration

00:03:07.311 --> 00:03:11.691
As if to laugh at us hopeless cowards

00:03:12.024 --> 00:03:15.444
Countless eyes stare at us

00:03:15.903 --> 00:03:21.784
This soul of mine breaks again and again

00:03:22.076 --> 00:03:24.996
All I can do is hold it tight

00:03:26.205 --> 00:03:31.252
Until the day it turns to ash

00:03:31.502 --> 00:03:34.130
I've absorbed all of this sorrow

00:03:34.255 --> 00:03:38.759
It has shaped me, painted me

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:41.596
But that's how we got here, right?

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:46.559
One step at a time, just like breathing

00:03:46.684 --> 00:03:49.061
These countless scars on my palm

00:03:49.187 --> 00:03:51.063
That no longer fade

00:03:51.189 --> 00:03:54.817
Are my badge, my story

00:03:55.109 --> 00:03:58.779
I faced the fear and shred it to pieces

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:01.949
And let it walk beside me once more

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:06.662
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

00:04:19.967 --> 00:04:20.843
ISHIDA RESIDENCE
I'm back!

00:04:21.886 --> 00:04:23.638
- Welcome home, Masa—
- Miss Masaki.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.181
Y-Yes?

00:04:25.515 --> 00:04:26.599
I'd like a word with you.

00:04:27.725 --> 00:04:30.937
I heard you fought against
a Hollow the other night

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.605
to save a Soul Reaper.

00:04:32.897 --> 00:04:33.898
Huh?

00:04:34.315 --> 00:04:37.568
No... I haven't done...
anything of the sort...

00:04:37.735 --> 00:04:39.821
You only disgrace yourself
by lying.

00:04:40.029 --> 00:04:41.030
Katagiri!

00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:43.115
Why did you do such a thing?

00:04:43.533 --> 00:04:44.951
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?!

00:04:45.409 --> 00:04:47.078
How could you
break the rules of the Quincies

00:04:47.161 --> 00:04:49.205
while in the care of
the Ishida Family?!

00:04:50.581 --> 00:04:51.582
Katagiri!

00:04:52.375 --> 00:04:53.793
Why did you tell Mother?!

00:04:54.377 --> 00:04:55.378
I thought I told you!

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.380
That there weren't
any problems that night!

00:04:58.923 --> 00:05:01.342
But there was...a problem!

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:02.802
What?

00:05:03.136 --> 00:05:06.639
Miss Masaki sustained a wound
from the Hollow's attack!

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:10.393
If she doesn't get proper
Quincy treatment

00:05:10.476 --> 00:05:11.894
from your father and mother,

00:05:12.562 --> 00:05:15.064
there is a possibility
the future Ishida bloodline

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.607
could become tainted!

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.067
That's nonsense!

00:05:18.442 --> 00:05:19.443
Nonsense?

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:22.029
It means everything to us!

00:05:22.613 --> 00:05:23.906
You said so yourself!

00:05:24.407 --> 00:05:28.035
That your marriage to Miss Masaki
was for the future of the Quincies!

00:05:30.288 --> 00:05:31.289
Damn it!

00:05:33.249 --> 00:05:35.042
Tell me the truth!

00:05:35.293 --> 00:05:36.794
W-Well, umm...

00:05:36.878 --> 00:05:38.379
Please wait, Mother!

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:41.340
Masaki isn't to blame
for what happened!

00:05:41.799 --> 00:05:44.218
- Masaki was...
- I-It's all right, Ryu!

00:05:44.719 --> 00:05:45.720
I'll be—

00:05:48.264 --> 00:05:49.265
Miss Masaki?

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:50.475
Masaki!

00:05:52.268 --> 00:05:54.145
What's wrong?!
Are you in pain?

00:05:58.399 --> 00:05:59.400
No...!

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:02.320
Is that...a Hollow's hole?

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:04.906
What do you think you're doing,
Ryuken?

00:06:04.989 --> 00:06:05.823
Where's Father?!

00:06:05.907 --> 00:06:07.950
We're trying to get in touch
with him right now.

00:06:08.326 --> 00:06:09.368
You will wait here.

00:06:11.579 --> 00:06:12.580
Wait!

00:06:12.663 --> 00:06:15.041
You can't be with that thing!

00:06:15.124 --> 00:06:17.043
You'll put yourself in danger!

00:06:17.126 --> 00:06:18.127
Come back!

00:06:18.753 --> 00:06:19.712
Please...

00:06:19.796 --> 00:06:21.380
Come back, Ryuken!

00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:30.932
What is this thing
that resembles a Hollow's hole?

00:06:31.349 --> 00:06:33.226
Why is she in so much pain?

00:06:33.893 --> 00:06:35.561
What's happening to Masaki?

00:06:36.229 --> 00:06:38.815
Why didn't I stop her by force?

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:42.693
Why didn't I do everything I could
to interrupt that battle?

00:06:43.653 --> 00:06:44.654
Why?!

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.040
Whew, that was a close one!

00:06:56.332 --> 00:06:57.875
It almost got you!

00:06:58.668 --> 00:06:59.669
It's you!

00:07:00.837 --> 00:07:01.921
What's wrong?

00:07:05.299 --> 00:07:06.926
Wait, let me take a look at her!

00:07:07.176 --> 00:07:08.177
Don't touch her!

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:11.931
Why do you think
this is happening to her?

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.517
It's because she protected you!

00:07:16.227 --> 00:07:20.940
She broke the rules of the Quincies
to protect you, a Soul Reaper...

00:07:21.399 --> 00:07:23.276
And because of that,
she was wounded...

00:07:24.068 --> 00:07:26.779
Why does Masaki
have to go through this?!

00:07:28.614 --> 00:07:30.825
That wound is what's causing this?

00:07:31.367 --> 00:07:33.077
I can't think of
any other explanation.

00:07:33.911 --> 00:07:34.954
I'll never forgive you for—

00:07:35.037 --> 00:07:36.372
Let's stop right there.

00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:40.585
There's no time to argue.

00:07:41.335 --> 00:07:43.880
Please come with me, both of you.

00:07:44.881 --> 00:07:47.842
I'll tell you the choices
you have to save her...

00:08:11.073 --> 00:08:12.450
I'm falling...

00:08:13.743 --> 00:08:16.162
Falling down a peaceful hole.

00:08:18.122 --> 00:08:22.710
It's quiet, dark and lonely...

00:08:23.961 --> 00:08:26.172
Yet, I'm not scared...

00:08:27.298 --> 00:08:28.299
I have this feeling...

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:32.220
that someone who needs me
is waiting for me down there...

00:08:34.639 --> 00:08:35.640
Who's there?

00:08:45.316 --> 00:08:46.108
"URAHARA'S SHOP"

00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:47.235
"URAHARA'S SHOP"
I've been researching the same
symptom that she is exhibiting

00:08:47.318 --> 00:08:49.821
I've been researching the same
symptom that she is exhibiting

00:08:49.904 --> 00:08:51.864
for close to a hundred years.

00:08:52.323 --> 00:08:53.324
A hundred years?!

00:08:53.699 --> 00:08:55.201
Just who are you anyway?

00:08:55.868 --> 00:08:58.496
My name is Kisuke Urahara.

00:08:58.871 --> 00:09:01.123
I was banished
from the Soul Society.

00:09:01.749 --> 00:09:03.709
You're Kisuke Urahara?

00:09:03.793 --> 00:09:05.878
I don't care who you are!

00:09:06.629 --> 00:09:08.381
Hurry up and restore Masaki
back to normal!

00:09:08.965 --> 00:09:11.134
I never said anything about
restoring her back to normal.

00:09:11.676 --> 00:09:12.677
What?

00:09:12.885 --> 00:09:13.845
I'll give it to you straight...

00:09:14.762 --> 00:09:15.888
That young lady...

00:09:16.639 --> 00:09:19.433
Masaki can never go back
to the way she used to be.

00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:23.729
Her condition
is known as Hollowfication.

00:09:24.814 --> 00:09:27.817
Hollowfication is what happens
when a Hollow's soul

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.569
is poured into another soul,

00:09:29.944 --> 00:09:33.239
destroying the boundaries
between the two souls.

00:09:33.531 --> 00:09:37.869
It is the result of an attempt to
sublimate a soul to a higher level.

00:09:38.244 --> 00:09:41.914
Originally, it was meant to
strengthen a Soul Reaper's soul.

00:09:42.498 --> 00:09:44.667
However,
souls that undergo Hollowfication

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.752
eventually become
mindless monsters,

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:50.715
and ultimately self-destruct
against their will...

00:09:51.215 --> 00:09:52.842
a process known as Soul Suicide.

00:09:53.926 --> 00:09:56.512
Hollowfication is
an uncontrollable technology.

00:09:57.054 --> 00:09:58.681
Uncontrollable?!

00:09:58.723 --> 00:10:02.101
Doesn't that mean there's no way
to save Masaki?

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:05.396
I can't return her
to the way she was,

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.356
but I can save her life...

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.905
During my research
over the past hundred years,

00:10:14.071 --> 00:10:17.408
I discovered a way to prevent
this Soul Suicide.

00:10:17.867 --> 00:10:20.661
It involves injecting something
into the victim's soul

00:10:20.745 --> 00:10:23.331
that can counteract Hollowfication...

00:10:23.998 --> 00:10:26.083
This allows the soul
to maintain balance

00:10:26.167 --> 00:10:28.127
so that their boundaries
won't get destroyed.

00:10:28.461 --> 00:10:30.588
Thus, preventing a Soul Suicide.

00:10:32.799 --> 00:10:34.008
Let me give you a specific example.

00:10:34.926 --> 00:10:37.470
If we inject
a Hollowfied Soul Reaper

00:10:37.553 --> 00:10:41.557
with a vaccine made from a Quincy's
light arrow and a human soul,

00:10:41.641 --> 00:10:44.393
they'll remain in
whatever state they're in.

00:10:45.228 --> 00:10:48.815
However, Quincies have
no resistance against Hollows,

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.651
so the vaccine isn't enough...

00:10:51.818 --> 00:10:53.277
I don't understand what you mean.

00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:55.071
To put it in simpler terms,

00:10:55.655 --> 00:10:56.823
we're trying to neutralize it

00:10:56.906 --> 00:10:59.951
by hitting it
with a counteracting force.

00:11:00.493 --> 00:11:03.830
To save this Quincy girl's life,
prevent her Hollowfication

00:11:03.913 --> 00:11:06.833
while retaining
her existence as a human...

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:10.753
we need a stronger
counteracting force.

00:11:11.712 --> 00:11:13.339
Something that must
remain by her side

00:11:13.422 --> 00:11:14.674
at all times until she dies...

00:11:14.799 --> 00:11:17.301
A powerful counteracting force

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.929
that continues to suppress
her Hollowfication...

00:11:20.054 --> 00:11:21.055
You're lying!

00:11:21.889 --> 00:11:24.767
There must be some other way...!

00:11:25.935 --> 00:11:27.270
You're quite sharp.

00:11:27.728 --> 00:11:28.938
You quickly figured it out.

00:11:29.856 --> 00:11:32.859
However...
you have no choice in this matter...

00:11:33.776 --> 00:11:35.528
The one with a choice...

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.114
is you, Isshin Shiba.

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:42.869
Soul Reapers are
the opposites of Quincies...

00:11:43.202 --> 00:11:45.496
Humans are the opposites
of Hollows...

00:11:45.746 --> 00:11:49.917
Currently, Masaki is a hybrid
of a Quincy and a Hollow...

00:11:50.835 --> 00:11:52.545
To counteract that, we need...

00:11:53.004 --> 00:11:55.923
someone who is a hybrid
of Soul Reaper and human.

00:11:58.843 --> 00:12:00.928
This is a special Gigai I created...

00:12:01.512 --> 00:12:04.098
It was created from a human soul.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:07.185
It envelops the soul
that enters it,

00:12:07.268 --> 00:12:08.728
making them completely human.

00:12:10.229 --> 00:12:11.522
You understand now, don't you?

00:12:12.148 --> 00:12:16.402
If you use this, you'll become
a hybrid of Soul Reaper and human.

00:12:17.028 --> 00:12:20.615
Which means you can
become her opposite.

00:12:22.283 --> 00:12:24.702
This is the choice
I'm presenting to you.

00:12:25.328 --> 00:12:29.874
However, this choice has
far too many downsides for you.

00:12:30.541 --> 00:12:32.043
I must bind your soul

00:12:32.126 --> 00:12:36.339
to Masaki's soul
and the Hollow within her

00:12:36.422 --> 00:12:39.008
with a string of Reishi.

00:12:39.634 --> 00:12:42.220
For as long as Masaki lives...

00:12:42.553 --> 00:12:43.554
No...

00:12:43.638 --> 00:12:46.432
It will be forever passed down
to her descendants.

00:12:46.891 --> 00:12:48.768
While you are in this Gigai,

00:12:49.185 --> 00:12:51.979
not only will you be unable to
use your Soul Reaper powers,

00:12:52.522 --> 00:12:54.816
but you won't even
be able to see Hollows.

00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:58.486
And it's likely that
once you get in...

00:12:59.153 --> 00:13:01.906
you'll never return to being
a Soul Reaper ever again...

00:13:04.951 --> 00:13:07.578
This has only downsides for him!

00:13:08.162 --> 00:13:10.122
There's no way he would accept
something like this!

00:13:10.665 --> 00:13:11.707
He'd never—

00:13:11.749 --> 00:13:13.376
Okay, I'll do it!

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.587
- What?!
- I said I'll do it!

00:13:16.671 --> 00:13:17.672
Hurry up!

00:13:17.755 --> 00:13:19.715
Man, you talk too much!

00:13:19.924 --> 00:13:21.175
I have to quit being a Soul Reaper

00:13:21.259 --> 00:13:22.593
and protect her
for the rest of her life, right?!

00:13:22.844 --> 00:13:24.220
Of course, I'll do it!

00:13:25.763 --> 00:13:27.473
You're okay with giving up
your current life?

00:13:27.765 --> 00:13:29.225
Are you kidding me?

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:30.601
Hell no!

00:13:31.394 --> 00:13:32.770
But so what?!

00:13:33.646 --> 00:13:35.273
If I let the person
who saved my life die

00:13:35.815 --> 00:13:37.650
because I couldn't make a decision...

00:13:38.067 --> 00:13:39.902
I know my future self
will laugh at me!

00:13:46.033 --> 00:13:46.993
Very well.

00:13:48.452 --> 00:13:49.912
I shall begin the procedure.

00:14:01.257 --> 00:14:02.258
Yo...

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:04.802
I'm here to protect you.

00:14:08.931 --> 00:14:10.016
Hey, Hollow!

00:14:10.475 --> 00:14:11.851
Now that I'm here,

00:14:11.934 --> 00:14:14.812
I won't let you
lay a finger on her!

00:14:17.815 --> 00:14:20.985
Getsuga...Tensho!

00:14:35.792 --> 00:14:38.711
I've successfully
connected your souls.

00:14:39.253 --> 00:14:40.630
She'll be all right now.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:41.881
I see...

00:14:42.256 --> 00:14:43.257
Thank goodness...

00:14:46.135 --> 00:14:49.847
You're that Soul Reaper
from the other day...

00:14:51.057 --> 00:14:53.893
Please tell me your name...!

00:14:55.895 --> 00:14:56.938
Thank goodness...

00:15:15.748 --> 00:15:18.084
Did you leave Miss Masaki behind...

00:15:18.876 --> 00:15:19.961
with the Soul Reaper?

00:15:21.838 --> 00:15:22.839
I did.

00:15:24.423 --> 00:15:26.342
Go home and tell my mother...

00:15:27.009 --> 00:15:30.680
that Ryuken is unqualified
to protect the Quincies.

00:15:31.556 --> 00:15:33.724
- No. I'm not leaving.
- I said go home.

00:15:34.225 --> 00:15:35.226
No.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.520
I will not leave you here
by yourself, Young Master.

00:15:37.937 --> 00:15:39.397
- Katagiri...!
- Master Ryuken...

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:40.731
Have you forgotten?

00:15:41.941 --> 00:15:47.488
It is my duty to devote
my entire life to serving you.

00:15:49.198 --> 00:15:50.867
From the day I first met you,

00:15:51.742 --> 00:15:54.162
my life has belonged to you.

00:15:55.204 --> 00:15:56.414
So please...

00:15:57.248 --> 00:15:58.958
Please do not be sad.

00:16:01.544 --> 00:16:03.546
When you are sad,

00:16:04.589 --> 00:16:06.507
it tears my heart apart.

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:09.302
When you cry...

00:16:09.385 --> 00:16:10.470
Katagiri...

00:16:11.762 --> 00:16:12.763
That's enough.

00:16:13.306 --> 00:16:14.307
Let's go home.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:22.190
Yes, understood, Young Master...

00:16:26.652 --> 00:16:29.989
After that,
soon after graduating high school,

00:16:30.615 --> 00:16:32.742
Masaki left the Ishida family.

00:16:33.618 --> 00:16:35.453
Her soul was mixed with a Hollow.

00:16:35.828 --> 00:16:38.623
For the Quincies,
it was the proper decision...

00:16:38.873 --> 00:16:39.624
"KUROSAKI CLINIC"

00:16:39.707 --> 00:16:40.500
"KUROSAKI CLINIC"
As for me,

00:16:40.583 --> 00:16:42.585
I made use of the medical skills
I learned at the Academy

00:16:42.877 --> 00:16:44.712
and opened up a small clinic.

00:16:46.255 --> 00:16:48.382
There were a ton of things
I had to learn,

00:16:48.883 --> 00:16:51.886
but with Urahara's help,
I somehow managed.

00:16:52.804 --> 00:16:54.388
When Masaki became
a college student,

00:16:54.639 --> 00:16:56.891
she would often come by
to make fun of my white coat.

00:16:57.892 --> 00:17:01.270
I told Masaki that I lost
my Soul Reaper powers

00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:05.441
because I was banished from
the Soul Society for screwing up.

00:17:06.275 --> 00:17:12.323
She probably saw through my lies
from the moment I told her that.

00:17:13.074 --> 00:17:15.034
I was terrible at lying

00:17:15.743 --> 00:17:17.954
and her intuition
was incredibly sharp.

00:17:19.038 --> 00:17:24.669
So lying to her felt trivial
and meaningless.

00:17:25.795 --> 00:17:28.673
She would always
see through my lies

00:17:28.756 --> 00:17:30.925
and forgive me for telling them...

00:17:32.176 --> 00:17:35.012
In a movie we saw together,

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.890
an old man compared the old woman
he spent many years with

00:17:37.974 --> 00:17:39.475
to the sun.

00:17:40.476 --> 00:17:42.812
I don't remember
the rest of the movie

00:17:43.062 --> 00:17:44.939
aside from the fact that
it made Masaki burst into tears,

00:17:45.648 --> 00:17:47.859
but that one line stuck with me...

00:17:48.943 --> 00:17:51.070
Masaki was like the sun...

00:17:52.446 --> 00:17:55.533
She attracted everything,
forgave everything,

00:17:55.825 --> 00:17:58.578
illuminated everything,
and spun everything around...

00:18:00.204 --> 00:18:01.205
I was just...

00:18:02.707 --> 00:18:06.002
happy to be spun around by her.

00:18:08.504 --> 00:18:09.505
And then...

00:18:10.006 --> 00:18:11.507
...you were born.

00:18:12.758 --> 00:18:15.178
You already know the rest.

00:18:16.262 --> 00:18:18.848
By coming into contact with Rukia,
you gained your Soul Reaper powers...

00:18:19.724 --> 00:18:21.976
By training with Urahara,
you gained your Zanpakuto...

00:18:22.518 --> 00:18:25.646
And through your battles
in the Soul Society,

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.441
the Hollow in you was awakened.

00:18:29.817 --> 00:18:34.906
The fact that it was released
means that my Soul Pressure

00:18:34.989 --> 00:18:37.241
was no longer able to suppress him.

00:18:37.992 --> 00:18:42.330
And so, my connection to my Gigai
and that Hollow was broken.

00:18:42.914 --> 00:18:44.832
That's how I regained
my Soul Reaper powers

00:18:44.916 --> 00:18:46.167
for the first time in 20 years.

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:51.297
I probably don't need to explain
the things you already experienced.

00:18:52.381 --> 00:18:53.382
But...

00:18:53.633 --> 00:18:56.260
there is still one thing
that you've experienced

00:18:56.844 --> 00:18:58.638
that you don't know
the whole story about.

00:18:59.472 --> 00:19:00.890
Nine years ago from today...

00:19:01.349 --> 00:19:02.725
June 17th...

00:19:03.726 --> 00:19:05.686
The day your mom died.

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:08.731
You need to know...

00:19:09.816 --> 00:19:14.278
the real reason
your mom died that day...

00:19:22.328 --> 00:19:25.289
Everything we had left behind

00:19:25.456 --> 00:19:29.794
Our breaths blending as mist

00:19:29.919 --> 00:19:34.090
without form or expression

00:19:34.215 --> 00:19:38.386
We lie buried as we glare
into the distance

00:19:38.719 --> 00:19:41.347
I can't hear anything

00:19:41.472 --> 00:19:44.600
I can't seem to cut anything

00:19:44.725 --> 00:19:47.103
It feels like I'm sinking

00:19:47.228 --> 00:19:49.063
Falling, falling

00:19:49.147 --> 00:19:50.148
Touching

00:19:50.273 --> 00:19:53.651
Eyes struck wide open

00:19:53.734 --> 00:19:56.988
Something no one has ever seen

00:19:57.113 --> 00:20:03.286
The furthest reaches are now visible to us

00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:07.248
It cannot be undone
and cannot be stopped

00:20:07.373 --> 00:20:10.710
This ensuing struggle

00:20:10.793 --> 00:20:15.590
Whisk it away beyond
the ends of the earth

00:20:15.715 --> 00:20:17.758
Along with our breaths

00:20:17.967 --> 00:20:19.260
Take everything

00:20:19.343 --> 00:20:24.015
Whisk it away beyond
the ends of the earth

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:26.058
Along with our futures

00:20:26.184 --> 00:20:27.935
Along with our world

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:32.273
Something no one has ever seen

00:20:32.398 --> 00:20:38.654
The furthest reaches are now
visible to us

00:20:38.738 --> 00:20:40.740
Don't you know God's demand?

00:20:40.865 --> 00:20:42.658
Don't you know God's demand?

00:20:42.783 --> 00:20:46.120
As we tear each other down

00:20:49.499 --> 00:20:50.500
Your mom...

00:20:51.042 --> 00:20:53.836
She wasn't supposed to
die that day...

00:20:54.754 --> 00:20:55.797
What do you mean?

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:58.841
Your mom...

00:20:59.425 --> 00:21:00.426
Masaki...

00:21:00.927 --> 00:21:02.678
Even though she had merged
with a Hollow,

00:21:03.304 --> 00:21:05.389
she was originally an Echt Quincy.

00:21:06.057 --> 00:21:09.560
Her defensive ability,
the Blut Vene,

00:21:09.644 --> 00:21:11.521
was exceptionally powerful.

00:21:13.022 --> 00:21:14.941
Not only could she defeat
Grand Fisher,

00:21:15.566 --> 00:21:19.862
but she could have done it without
getting a single scratch on her.

00:21:20.363 --> 00:21:21.364
However...

00:21:29.831 --> 00:21:31.582
That didn't happen...

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:33.501
Why not?

00:21:33.584 --> 00:21:36.712
It's because she lost
her Quincy powers that day...

00:21:36.838 --> 00:21:37.839
But how?!

00:21:38.673 --> 00:21:40.842
What happened...nine years ago?!

00:21:41.884 --> 00:21:42.927
Auswählen.

00:21:43.261 --> 00:21:45.221
AUSWÄHLEN

00:21:45.847 --> 00:21:49.267
It's a Quincy selection process
conducted by Yhwach himself.

00:21:51.477 --> 00:21:53.187
I heard of a Quincy tale

00:21:53.271 --> 00:21:56.107
that sang praises of a king
who was sealed away.

00:21:57.024 --> 00:21:58.109
According to that,

00:21:58.943 --> 00:22:03.322
The confined Quincy King
regains his pulse after 900 years.

00:22:03.698 --> 00:22:05.992
His mind after 90 years.

00:22:06.492 --> 00:22:08.828
His strength after 9 years.

00:22:09.745 --> 00:22:15.668
Yhwach robbed Quincies
he deemed impure of their powers

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:17.712
and made them his own.

00:22:18.254 --> 00:22:19.380
As a result...

00:22:19.797 --> 00:22:25.052
Uryu's frail mother,
Kanae Katagiri, lost her life...

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:30.808
And how Masaki lost her powers
and lost her life in battle...

00:22:31.517 --> 00:22:32.518
How?

00:22:32.852 --> 00:22:34.729
How is he able to do that?

00:22:35.563 --> 00:22:36.564
Is it because he's their king?

00:22:36.939 --> 00:22:38.733
Who is Yhwach anyway?!

00:22:41.068 --> 00:22:44.071
Yhwach is the Father
of the Quincies.

00:22:44.906 --> 00:22:46.908
The Quincies started from him...

00:22:47.325 --> 00:22:52.205
And all Quincies have his blood
running in their veins.

00:22:53.414 --> 00:22:56.667
The memories within
your Spiritual Pressure

00:22:56.751 --> 00:22:58.669
have awakened too soon.

00:22:58.753 --> 00:23:01.547
It is unable to contain Quincies!

00:23:01.631 --> 00:23:04.801
You don't know anything
about yourself, do you?

00:23:05.301 --> 00:23:08.846
Not even about...your own mother.

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:13.768
Farewell, Ichigo Kurosaki...

00:23:14.685 --> 00:23:18.731
...my son...born in the dark...

00:23:22.568 --> 00:23:23.569
Dad...

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:26.781
Thanks.

00:23:31.828 --> 00:23:32.787
No problem.

00:23:39.961 --> 00:23:41.087
Hey, Ichigo...

00:23:44.298 --> 00:23:47.885
You forgot this...
I came to deliver it to you.

00:23:54.809 --> 00:23:56.769
Thanks, Ms. Ikumi.

00:23:59.147 --> 00:24:00.148
Dad...

00:24:03.484 --> 00:24:05.111
I'm going.

00:24:10.533 --> 00:24:14.370
"I believe the world
is full of danger."

00:24:14.495 --> 00:24:17.707
"I want to protect you from it."

00:24:18.040 --> 00:24:23.921
"Only because inside me is
the same impulse as that danger."
